  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of the production chain of non-traditional vegetables</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smallholder vegetable farmers face barriers to selling their produce directly to wholesale buyers. Asociacin Coordinacin Regional de Cooperativas Integrales (CORCI) invests in the production of vegetables aimed at export markets and works to increase women&apos;s participation within the organization. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Guatemala. CORCI&apos;s activities strengthen communities through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
